{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1310204001:0":{"text":"各位远道而来的朋友，天气这样寒冷，要不要来吃些热气腾腾的食物暖和一下呢？","source_cn":"各位远道而来的朋友，天气这样寒冷，要不要来吃些热气腾腾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B4F96C91E832D73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310204002:0":{"text":"哦嚯！这家餐厅可是雪松镇里我最喜欢的地方了。哎呀，有我喜欢的面包圈！","source_cn":"哦嚯！这家餐厅可是雪松镇里我最喜欢的地方了。哎呀，有我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AC4372066C5C636","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310204003:0":{"text":"这种裹了糖浆的面包圈里面填满了新鲜浆果做成的果酱，棒极了！来，你们也来吃吃看。","source_cn":"这种裹了糖浆的面包圈里面填满了新鲜浆果做成的果酱，棒极...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB90598B7E9457DB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310204004:0":{"text":"嗯……唔……酸甜可口，好吃！呼金先生，原来你对雪松镇的美食这么了解啊！","source_cn":"嗯……唔……酸甜可口，好吃！呼金先生，原来你对雪松镇的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E7EAEB4186A3A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310204005:0":{"text":"哈！很多年前我来过这里，虽然没赶上祭典，但可是大饱了口福。我记得你们这里有种特别好吃的夹满馅料的面包……","source_cn":"哈！很多年前我来过这里，虽然没赶上祭典，但可是大饱了口...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FD1FDF2C9BC802C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310204006:0":{"text":"这位客人，你说的一定是我家餐厅最出名的烤炉面包吧！","source_cn":"这位客人，你说的一定是我家餐厅最出名的烤炉面包吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB4FA8AF4950F2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310204007:0":{"text":"就是它！热乎乎的炉子里现烤出来的、上面堆满了香肠、蔬菜和奶酪的长条面包，我对它可是念念不忘。","source_cn":"就是它！热乎乎的炉子里现烤出来的、上面堆满了香肠、蔬菜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D32E953D3F2FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310204008:0":{"text":"喔……瞧这能拉出丝来的浓香奶酪，配上烤面包的麦香、香肠的肉香和蔬菜的清香，连铁头都要流口水了！","source_cn":"喔……瞧这能拉出丝来的浓香奶酪，配上烤面包的麦香、香肠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x194DA596C5E5E706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310204009:1":{"text":"唔唔，太好吃了！如果能再有些喝的……","source_cn":"唔唔，太好吃了！如果能再有些喝的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A9DD2A9FBC401D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310204010:0":{"text":"当然有啦！各种蘑菇和肉炖出来的蘑菇汤，或者是放了雪葱萝和冰芹碎的清鸡汤——保证你喝到家的味道！","source_cn":"当然有啦！各种蘑菇和肉炖出来的蘑菇汤，或者是放了雪葱萝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B3F556F668EE935","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310204011:0":{"text":"这样寒冷的冬天里喝上一碗，热乎乎，和靠在火炉边睡觉一样舒服！","source_cn":"这样寒冷的冬天里喝上一碗，热乎乎，和靠在火炉边睡觉一样舒服！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88C269AA6AB4DD90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310204012:0":{"text":"真是、真是太香了！！！主人，你也尝尝！","source_cn":"真是、真是太香了！！！主人，你也尝尝！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x596360F5597F1B14","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"真是、真是太香了！！！主人，你也尝尝！","female":"真是、真是太香了！！！主人，你也尝尝！","variant_male_record_index":"144861","variant_female_record_index":"144862","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:餐厅老板娘科萨娃":{"text":"餐厅老板娘科萨娃","source":"餐厅老板娘科萨娃","status":"source"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"呼金","source":"呼金","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":4}}